 * structure, class helpers and progressive-enhancement motion of the sibling
 * spoke src/pages/gym-flooring-rolls/zainduo.astro and the parent hub
 * src/pages/gym-flooring-rolls.astro.
 *
 * ─── ROUTING ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * The content entry src/content/products/zainactive-rolls.yaml carries
 * `path: /gym-flooring-rolls/zainactive-rolls`. To avoid a duplicate-route
 * build error the matching branch is filtered out of getStaticPaths in
 * src/pages/[...slug].astro — the same pattern already used for zainfit,
 * zainsquare and zainduo. The YAML entry stays as data; this file serves the
 * URL.
 *
 * ─── DATA INTEGRITY FLAGS (CLAUDE.md §0 "Data Integrity" + §6) ────────────
 * zainactive-rolls.yaml lists roll width, roll length and thickness options as
 * `null` "to collect". Every technical figure rendered in Section 5 (1.22 m roll
 * width, 10–15 m roll length, 6/8/10/12 mm thickness, 1000–1050 kg/m³ density,
 * 60–65 Shore A hardness, MDI-polyurethane-bonded recycled-SBR + EPDM-fleck
 * composition, full-spread PU adhesive glue-down, 18–22 dB impact-sound
 * reduction) was supplied in the page-build request, NOT in
 * Rukn_Al_Zain_SEO_Content_Brief.docx. Treat every value as PROVISIONAL and
 * confirm against real product test data / manufacturer certificates before
 * go-live.
 *
 * ─── IMAGE ASSETS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Client-supplied JPEGs in public/images/gym-flooring-rolls/, intrinsic
 * dimensions wired below to prevent layout shift:
 *   - zainactive-rolls-hero.jpg                       (hero, 1024×1024)
 *   - zainactive-rolls-problem-solution-dramatic.jpg  (landscape, 1376×768)
 *   - zainactive-rolls-technical-specifications.jpg   (square, 1024×1024)
